{"type":"click","text":"A\n    \n      Horizontal Flow (Left-to-Right)\n      Pipeline stages flow left-to-right like a shell command. Each node shows: operation name, parameters, and a thumbnail preview of the image at that stage. JSON state shown on hover/click. Pipe symbols (|) connect the nodes.\n      \n        \n          \n          \n            load\n            \n            cat.jpg\n          \n          |\n          \n          \n            resize\n            \n            50%\n          \n          |\n          \n          \n            grayscale\n            \n          \n          |\n          \n          \n            save\n            \n            out.png\n          \n        \n      \n      \n        ProsMirrors shell command syntax visuallyNatural reading directionPipe symbol reinforces the metaphor\n        ConsHorizontal scroll on mobile / long pipelinesMulti-image (--as/--on) harder to show","choice":"a","id":null,"timestamp":1774382754478}
